msgid ""
"Vérification en cours… En cas d'interruption, consultez l'état enregistré "
"avant une nouvelle action."
msgstr ""
"Checking… If the connection drops, check the saved status before trying "
"again."

#: static/accounts/forms.js:22
msgid "mot de passe"
msgstr "password"

